[2026-06-05T03:19:05.944Z] [DETAIL] [lesson] Welcome to the HCIA-WLAN Huawei Certified Wireless LAN Engineer online course. A WLAN is a cost-effective network access mode based on wireless technologies. The HCIA-WLAN Huawei-certified WLAN engineer online course is designed to train and certify WLAN engineers who are capable of deploying and maintaining WLAN applications for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the WLAN field, and are capable of planning, designing, and deploying WLAN networks that meet requirements. After passing the HCIA-WLAN V3.0 certification, you will have a clear understanding of the WLAN architecture and functions of each component, WLAN configurations, and how to design and deploy a WLAN network. HCIA-WLAN V3.0 greatly optimizes the overall logical architecture, simplifies old technologies, and adds WLAN bottom-layer technologies, 802.11 theoretical rate calculation, and Wi-Fi 6 products and technologies. You can deploy and maintain WLAN applications for small and medium-sized enterprises. Be competent for positions such as WLAN engineers. In this course, we need to systematically understand WLAN and get a basic introduction to WLAN. Then you will learn: 1. WLAN Technical Basics 2. WLAN Security and Configuration 3. WLAN Troubleshooting 4. WLAN Project Deployment - Starting
